WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
Brother Fangyang, you misunderstood

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,500
Master Cui and I are just friends

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,680
Do you remember this, sir?

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,380
He was in Shuntianfu Prison at that time

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:11,880
You said you wanted to take with me the earthly energy and heavenly sins of Cheng Guo Gongfu

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,380
Married into the Cui family

7
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,170
Brother Fang Yang

8
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,670
I did that to ask Mr. Cui to help you.

9
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,170
If I weren't anxious

10
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:22,170
How could you say such things that insult your innocence?

11
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:26,620
What do you mean

12
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,710
I would like to thank you even more

13
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:30,710
I don't have Fangbo

14
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:33,030
Let’s send Miss Song out of the house.

15
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:34,530
Master, this

16
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:38,560
Zhang Long Zhaohu

17
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:41,190
Open the box yes
